     "text": "```json\n{\"count\": 1, \"rationale\": \"The target crown:obtain is an OR of h5_0:pivot, h5_2:traverse and h5_1:obtain, so all three must be cut. Blocking the single step h2_0:reach does this. h3_1:access (OR, whose only parent is h2_0) becomes unreachable. h3_0:traverse and h3_2:traverse (both AND, each requiring h2_0) become unreachable. As a result, h5_0 (AND, needs h3_1 and h3_0), h5_1 (AND, needs h3_1) and h5_2 (OR, whose only parent is h3_2) are all unreachable, so crown:obtain cannot be reached. The target is reachable when nothing is blocked (for example via h2_0 to h3_1 and h3_0 to h5_0), so at least one block is required, making 1 the minimum.\"}\n```"
